# The screens reference/screenshots/golden.sh photographs on both servers:
# role<TAB>path as wp-admin spells it<TAB>selectors to mask (comma list, or -)
# Roles: administrator, editor and subscriber log in with the password of
# the fixture's admin; visitor does not. A path under wp-admin is asked of
# HyScribe as /hs-admin/<file> without the .php, wp-login.php as /hs-login.
# Masked boxes are painted over on both sides: what differs on purpose
# (the time the server prints).
visitor	/wp-login.php	-
visitor	/wp-login.php?action=lostpassword	-
administrator	/wp-admin/index.php	-
administrator	/wp-admin/edit.php	-
